#: main.cpp:102
msgid ""
"<qt>Here you can change your personal information, which will be used in "
"mail programs and word processors, for example. You can change your login "
"password by clicking <em>Change Password...</em>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Tut možna źmianić pryvatnyja źviestki, jakimi karystajucca paštary, "
"tekstavyja redaktary dy inšyja prahramy. Svoj parol možna źmianić, kliknuŭšy "
"ŭ knopku <em>Źmiani parol...</em>.</qt>"

#: main.cpp:116
msgid ""
"A program error occurred: the internal program 'kdepasswd' could not be "
"found. You will not be able to change your password."
msgstr ""
"U prahramie ŭźnikła pamyłka: nie ŭdałosia znajści ŭnutranuju prahramu "
"„kdepasswd”. Ty nia zmožaš źmianić svoj parol."

#: main.cpp:215
msgid "Please enter your password in order to save your settings:"
msgstr "Upišy svoj parol, kab zapisać nałady:"

#: main.cpp:218
msgid "You must enter your password in order to change your information."
msgstr "Kab źmianić ułasnyja pryvatnyja źviestki, treba ŭpisać svoj parol."

#: main.cpp:228
msgid "You must enter a correct password."
msgstr "Treba ŭpisać pravilny parol."

#: main.cpp:232
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An error occurred and your password has probably not been changed. The error "
"message was:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Uźnikła pamyłka. Mabyć, tvoj parol nie źmianiŭsia. Pamyłka viarnuła "
"nastupnaje paviedamleńnie:\n"
"%1"

#: main.cpp:246
#, kde-format
msgid "There was an error saving the image: %1"
msgstr "Padčas zapisu vyjavy ŭźnikła pamyłka: %1"

#: main.cpp:272 main.cpp:306
msgid "Your administrator has disallowed changing your image."
msgstr "Tvoj administratar zabaraniŭ źmianiać vyjavy."

#: main.cpp:339
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"%1 does not appear to be an image file.\n"
"Please use files with these extensions:\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"„%1” nia jość vyjavaju.\n"
"Vybiraj fajły z hetkimi pašyreńniami:\n"
"%2"

